# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for Tile2D.
#
# The only Vulkan implementation available in this container is SwiftShader, a software rasterizer
# that runs its own worker threads. ThreadSanitizer reports races inside its code (and inside the
# Vulkan loader) that say nothing about Tile2D: they appear with or without our renderer, and the
# library is not built with instrumentation. Suppressing them keeps the signal on our own threads -
# the server thread, the client thread and the shared memory channel.
race:libvk_swiftshader
race:libvulkan
